Generic single-database configuration with async SQLAlchemy support.

## Usage

### Create a new migration
```bash
alembic revision --autogenerate -m "description of changes"
```

### Apply migrations
```bash
alembic upgrade head
```

### Rollback migrations
```bash
alembic downgrade -1  # Rollback one migration
alembic downgrade base  # Rollback all migrations
```

### View migration history
```bash
alembic history
alembic current
```

## Notes

- This configuration uses async SQLAlchemy
- Database URL is automatically loaded from settings
- All models in src/models/orm.py are included in autogenerate
